WEBVTT

00:32:58.730 --> 00:33:00.285
it would be up to them.

00:33:00.309 --> 00:33:04.188
So people are extremely
hardworking, hungry,

00:33:04.212 --> 00:33:09.164
and they really treasure
this first time in thousands of years

00:33:09.188 --> 00:33:13.752
anyone can have an opportunity
to be an entrepreneur and make it.

00:33:14.053 --> 00:33:17.387
And that's what makes them
work 100 hours a week.

00:33:17.831 --> 00:33:19.633
And also, role models.

00:33:19.657 --> 00:33:22.601
They see people like them, like Jack Ma.

00:33:22.625 --> 00:33:25.410
Someone who never went to a great school,

00:33:25.434 --> 00:33:28.926
but yet became one of China's
most successful and richest people.